  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new style of the quick menu is nice. However, after using quick menu for a while i feel there is an issue with wings. Every time i want to use wings in VR - Opening and using them always feels like a struggle because of how small the elements are, and also because the menu is tied to the hand one wing feels too close to the hand while the other one is actually too far away that means you have to be more precise which takes a bit longer and overall just feels awkward.\nalso quick menu being tied to a hand was always one of my favorite things, instead it would be nice if wings were somehow changed or adjusted.",
